  "scopeNotes": [
    "Same 9-theme, 3-strand shape as this project's existing Grade 7/8/9 Mandarin builds and the French/Arabic/German G6 builds: Greetings and Introduction, Family, My Surroundings, Time, Fun and Enjoyment, Foods and Drinks, My Body, Weather and Environment, Getting Around — each with one Listening and Speaking (3 lessons), one Reading (2 lessons), one Writing (1 lesson) sub-strand. 27 sub-strands total, matching 27 skill files.",
    "Target proficiency stated in the design's own Essence Statement: 'basic proficiency equivalent to A1/YCT 2' by the end of primary — content should stay at that basic level (simple vocabulary, short set phrases), not attempt advanced grammar.",
    "All hanzi/pinyin/meaning triples below are taken directly from the KICD design's own worked examples in its Suggested Learning Experiences columns — not invented. Numbers, months, and a few structural phrases (e.g. 比 for comparison, 方位词 location words) recur across themes exactly as the source presents them."
  ],
